{
    "background_story": "Tommy was a tiny, winged creature, a member of the microchiroptera family. As a little brown bat, he lived in a cozy colony beneath the eaves of an old church. Tommy's world was one of darkness and echolocation, using his high-frequency calls to navigate and hunt for insects. Despite his small size, he was a skilled flyer, darting and weaving through the night air with incredible agility. Tommy's favorite pastime was exploring the church's labyrinthine attic, chasing after stray mosquitoes and moths. His keen senses and quick reflexes made him a master of his domain, and his colony looked up to him as a leader and a hero. As the sun set, Tommy would take to the skies, his leathery wings beating rapidly as he disappeared into the night, a tiny, mysterious figure.",
